  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>STAT_U03_L06_Q01</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> STAT_U03_L06_Q01</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.STAT.BVM.7</p><p>What type of variables are summarized in a two-way frequency table?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[One numerical variable only]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[That would be univariate numerical data.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[One equation only]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Equations are not frequency tables.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Two categorical variables]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Two-way frequency tables summarize bivariate categorical data.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[A residual and a prediction]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Those belong to model fit, not categorical tables.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>STAT_U03_L06_Q02</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> STAT_U03_L06_Q02</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.STAT.BVM.7</p><p>What is bivariate categorical data?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[One category measured once]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Bivariate means two variables.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Two numerical predictions]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Those are numerical, not categorical.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Two categorical variables measured for each case]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Bivariate categorical data involve two category variables.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[A single average]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[An average summarizes numerical data.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>STAT_U03_L06_Q03</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> STAT_U03_L06_Q03</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.STAT.BVM.7</p><div class='assessment-visual'><p><strong>Two-way table:</strong></p><table border='1' cellpadding='5' cellspacing='0' style='border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0;'><tr><th>Grade / Preference</th><th>Online notes</th><th>Printed notes</th><th>Row total</th></tr><tr><td>Grade 9</td><td>18</td><td>12</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>Grade 10</td><td>22</td><td>38</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Column total</td><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>90</td></tr></table><p>Inside cells are joint frequencies. Row and column totals are marginal frequencies. The grand total is 90.</p></div><p>In a two-way table, a count inside the table is called what?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Marginal frequency]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Marginal frequencies are row or column totals.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Grand total]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[The grand total is the total number of cases.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Correlation coefficient]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[That measures linear association for numerical data.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Joint frequency]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Inside cells combine one row category and one column category.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
  <question type="multichoice">
    <name>
      <text>STAT_U03_L06_Q04</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p><strong>Question ID:</strong> STAT_U03_L06_Q04</p><p><strong>MLA Standard:</strong> MLA.STAT.BVM.7</p><div class='assessment-visual'><p><strong>Two-way table:</strong></p><table border='1' cellpadding='5' cellspacing='0' style='border-collapse:collapse;margin:8px 0;'><tr><th>Grade / Preference</th><th>Online notes</th><th>Printed notes</th><th>Row total</th></tr><tr><td>Grade 9</td><td>18</td><td>12</td><td>30</td></tr><tr><td>Grade 10</td><td>22</td><td>38</td><td>60</td></tr><tr><td>Column total</td><td>40</td><td>50</td><td>90</td></tr></table><p>Inside cells are joint frequencies. Row and column totals are marginal frequencies. The grand total is 90.</p></div><p>In a two-way table, a row total is called what?</p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
    <defaultgrade>1.0000000</defaultgrade>
    <penalty>0.3333333</penalty>
    <hidden>0</hidden>
    <single>true</single>
    <shuffleanswers>true</shuffleanswers>
    <answernumbering>abc</answernumbering>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Joint frequency]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[A joint frequency is an inside cell.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Correlation]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Correlation is for numerical variables.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="0" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Residual]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Residuals compare actual and predicted values.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
    <answer fraction="100" format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[Marginal frequency]]></text>
      <feedback format="html">
        <text><![CDATA[Row and column totals are marginal frequencies.]]></text>
      </feedback>
    </answer>
  </question>
